@startuml route-state
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam shadowing false
title Behaviour — pending-request state of one DoCAN route (TransportRouter, ARC-03)

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Transmitting : physical request accepted\n[buffer free] / DoIP ACK
Idle --> Idle : unsolicited response /\ndiscard, count (SWR-042)

Transmitting --> WaitResponse : ISO-TP TX done /\nstart P2
Transmitting --> Idle : N_As / N_Bs timeout /\ncount tx failure (SWR-018)
Transmitting --> Idle : tester disconnected /\nabort TX (SWR-041)

WaitResponse --> Idle : final response /\nforward, observer.routeResponded()
WaitResponse --> WaitPending : NRC 0x78 /\nforward, start P2*
WaitResponse --> Idle : P2 expired /\ncount, observer.routeTimedOut() (SWR-016)
WaitResponse --> Idle : tester disconnected /\nrelease (SWR-041)

WaitPending --> WaitPending : NRC 0x78 /\nforward, restart P2*
WaitPending --> Idle : final response /\nforward, observer.routeResponded()
WaitPending --> Idle : P2* expired /\ncount, observer.routeTimedOut()
WaitPending --> Idle : tester disconnected /\nrelease

state Idle : request to this route while not Idle\n→ NACK 0x05 (SWR-015)
@enduml
